  "app/README.md": "# app/ (yours)\n\nbildr never writes here. Files in this folder override the same path in any layer. For example, `app/components/blog/PostCard.vue` replaces the generated `layers/blog/app/components/blog/PostCard.vue`, and the generated one stays in sync with the editor.\n",
